---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PhotoSlot from '../components/PhotoSlot.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Impact & Research" description="Real programmes we've run, and our research and innovation work.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green mb-4">Projects & Impact</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight max-w-2xl">
      What we've actually done — not just what we plan to do.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      We're early-stage, so this page will grow. Here's a real programme we've delivered.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-line">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
      <PhotoSlot label="Add real photos from the Ibadan school/community programme" aspect="aspect-[4/3]" />
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green mb-2">2025 · Ibadan, Nigeria</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">School & community wellbeing programme</h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate uppercase tracking-wide">Problem</p>
            <p class="text-ink mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Secondary-school students in Ibadan had limited access to clear, practical education on
              sexual health, personal wellbeing, and basic menstrual hygiene support.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate uppercase tracking-wide">What we did</p>
            <p class="text-ink mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Ran educational sessions in schools and communities on sexual health, sexual purity and
              personal wellbeing, paired with basic menstrual hygiene support for girls.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate uppercase tracking-wide">Who we reached</p>
            <p class="text-ink mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Secondary-school students across schools and communities in Ibadan, with a particular focus
              on girls.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate uppercase tracking-wide">What we learned</p>
            <p class="text-ink mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              That EdTech InnoHub isn't only about building products — taking education directly into
              communities, in person, is core to how we create impact.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-mint py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Research & Innovation</h2>
      <p class="text-slate leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        We use research and technology to understand educational and social problems, and to develop
        solutions relevant to the Nigerian and African context — with particular interest in solutions
        that work in low-resource environments: mobile-first, offline-friendly, low-tech, and localised.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 text-center py-12 border border-dashed border-line rounded-lg bg-paper">
        <p class="text-slate">
          Our first research notes, reports and experiments will be published here as they're ready.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
